Our goal is not simply to create training content. We build learning experiences that help&nbsp; people become productive faster, implement Cognite solutions successfully, follow best&nbsp; practices, and ultimately accelerate customer value realization.&nbsp;

As an Academy Engineer, you will play a critical role in this mission by combining deep&nbsp; technical expertise, instructional thinking, content creation, and training delivery .&nbsp;

We are looking for an experienced and technically strong Academy Engineer who can&nbsp; translate complex Cognite technology and real-world implementation practices into engaging,&nbsp; practical, and scalable learning experiences.

